    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/charleston-il</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-charleston-il</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>City council voted 5-0 on Tuesday night (Oct 6; reports published Oct 7-8) for a moratorium on new applications for data centers and battery energy storage systems; residential battery storage on 1-2 family dwellings exempt. Runs until Oct 6, 2027 or until the city adopts new regulations, whichever first (end date per MyRadioLink). Zoning board hearing Sep 24 recommended approval. No ordinance text read.</description>
